{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23611","headline":"松江亭携乐观渔宴宿 · 白居易","name":"松江亭携乐观渔宴宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"震泽平芜岸，松江落叶波。\n在官常梦想，爲客始经过。\n水面排罾网，船头簇绮罗。\n朝盘鱠红鲤，夜烛舞青娥。\n雁断知风急，潮平见月多。\n繁丝与促管，不解和渔歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}